# Step 6: Review
## First line (every PR)
- Wait until CI and Cursor Automations have finished. Do not treat an in-progress run as the review.
- Then read every finding per `project-cursor-automations.mdc` (PR review, Find vulnerabilities, Bugbot; CI triage if CI was red), including medium and lower.
- Green CI (build, tests, gitleaks). Red CI: ask the owner before merge (`00-core.mdc`). Formats and impersonal wording: `playbook-git-pr.mdc` and `00-core.mdc`.
- Docs-with-code: PR names the `Doc-` page to update, or «вики не затронута».

## Findings (reply before merge)
- After the checks have finished, every open finding gets a reply on its thread before merge. Impersonal Russian. Cursor Automations may be named when the sentence needs it. Do not name a role or another agent as the actor.
- If a newer commit already fixed the finding, do not re-open it: reply «исправлено» (or the same meaning) with the head sha.
- Otherwise the reply is one of: «неактуально: <причина>»; «принято, будет исправлено»; «исправлено в `<sha>`»; «нужно решение владельца: <вопрос>».
- «Будет исправлено» is not a finished state. Fix, push, then reply «исправлено» with the head sha. Do not claim fixed before that push.
- Do not squash-merge while any finding has no reply, or while a reply only promises a fix. «Нужно решение владельца» also blocks merge until the owner decides.
- Leave the thread clearly finished: the closing reply states the outcome, and the review conversation is marked resolved when the UI allows.
- On a review thread a short reply is enough. Use «Итог / Подробно / Дальше» when the reply is a new PR or issue comment.

## Escalation (lead via cloud agent)
Lead runs a dedicated review (itself for trivial diffs, else cloud agent briefed with `.cursor/agents/architect.md`) when any of:
- an automation left a blocker or a validated finding;
- the PR is risky (auth, secrets, payments, infra, migrations, public API contracts);
- the diff is large or crosses services;
- the Feature/Epic page changed in «Архитектура» or «Решения» for this work;
- the lead or owner asks for a human/architect pass.

Otherwise, when every finding reply is finished and no ask-before-merge case in `00-core.mdc` applies, the lead merges on automations + green CI (bugs, tiny fixes, routine cloud-agent PRs) and notifies the owner after merge.

## Verdict
- Page mismatch: changes requested, or a «Решения» row if the page is wrong.
- Verdict: lead posts a Russian GitHub review/comment (template). Server-side security for risky infra still needs the lead (server access), not only automation comments.
